# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Format: source  destination  status

# The Tesla job's URL carried a typo in from the form ("modle"). It was live and
# in the sitemap for three days, so it redirects permanently instead of 404ing.
# The assets rule sends any saved or indexed image link to the redacted copy.
/work/2024-tesla-modle-3-dent-repair                 /work/2024-tesla-model-3-dent-repair                 301
/assets/work/2024-tesla-modle-3-dent-repair/*        /assets/work/2024-tesla-model-3-dent-repair/:splat   301

# The Ford Focus after photos showed a readable license plate. Redacted copies
